SYMA AIR needs to be connected with the corresponding unmanned aerial vehicle through Wi-Fi. It includes the following functions:
1. Real-time high-definition image transmission;
2. Take photos and videos;
3. AI blessing;
5. Support GPS;

This is an APP that connects and controls the UAV via WiFi,
1. Photographs and videos;
2. Real-time image transmission;
3. Gesture capture and video recording;
4. Trajectory control;
5. Gravity Sensor Manipulation;
6. Rocker control;
7.3D Scattering Screen;
8. Mirror Reversal;
